sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as AGN Operator<br/>9090/TCP HTTP
    participant PeerOp as Peer Site Operator<br/>7946/UDP
    participant PeerSig as Peer Signals<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS
    participant EnrollSvc as Enrollment Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS
    participant OverlaySync as Overlay-Sync Sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Praxis as Praxis Gateway<br/>8080/TCP
    participant RemoteGW as Remote Site Gateway<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS
    participant Backend as Inference Backend

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Admin,K8sAPI: Flow 1: CRD Creation
        Admin->>K8sAPI: Create GridNetwork, InferenceProvider CRs
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch notification (kube-rs)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Operator,PeerOp: Flow 2: Cross-Site Gossip
        Operator->>PeerOp: SWIM membership update<br/>7946/UDP AES-256-GCM
        PeerOp->>Operator: SWIM state delta<br/>7946/UDP AES-256-GCM
        Note over Operator,PeerOp: Delta CRDTs: LWW registers,<br/>OR-Sets, G-Counters
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 230)
        Note over Operator,PeerSig: Flow 3: Signal Polling
        Operator->>PeerSig: GET /grid/v1alpha1/signals<br/>mTLS (site identity cert)
        PeerSig-->>Operator: Provider metrics<br/>(queue depth, KV cache pressure)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 245)
        Note over Operator,OverlaySync: Flow 4: Overlay Publication
        Operator->>Operator: Score providers<br/>(noMetrics / queueDepth / kvCachePressure)
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Write routing overlay ConfigMap<br/>Content-addressed envelope
        K8sAPI->>OverlaySync: ConfigMap watch event
        OverlaySync->>Praxis: Atomic file write to emptyDir
        Note over Praxis: Hot-reload overlay<br/>(no restart)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 245)
        Note over Admin,PG: Flow 5: Site Enrollment
        Admin->>EnrollSvc: POST /v1alpha1/enrollmenttokens<br/>mTLS
        EnrollSvc->>PG: Store token<br/>TLS 1.2+
        EnrollSvc-->>Admin: Enrollment token
        Operator->>EnrollSvc: POST /v1alpha1/enrollments<br/>One-time token
        EnrollSvc->>PG: Record enrollment<br/>TLS 1.2+
        EnrollSvc->>K8sAPI: Write grid-site-identity Secret
        EnrollSvc-->>Operator: Site identity certificate
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Praxis,Backend: Flow 6: Inference Request (Data Plane)
        participant Client as External Client
        Client->>Praxis: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>API key / Bearer
        Praxis->>RemoteGW: Forward to best-scored site<br/>mTLS (site identity)
        RemoteGW->>Backend: Proxy to inference backend<br/>Credential injection
        Backend-->>RemoteGW: Inference response
        RemoteGW-->>Praxis: Response
        Praxis-->>Client: Response
    end
